# Maxima: Maxima Manual (5.47): language reference; requirements/languages/maxima.md
name     maxima mac
keyword  if then else elseif for from thru step while unless do block return and or not lambda
builtin  true false pi %pi %e %i inf diff integrate solve expand factor simplify limit sum print
builtin  plot2d ratsimp
ident-extra    %
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
operators  +-*/^=<>:!'.$;,
calls
